{"slug":"Universal-Script-Face-All-Script-for-yall-skidded-require-guis-35718","_id":"67fe8dcaee38dc764a633c87","title":"Face All Script for yall skidded require guis","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Script for changing all players`s face (use at require, not just in basic executor)","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\n\nlocal function click()\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\tlocal character = player.Character\n\t\tif character then -- removing head\n\t\t\tlocal head = character:FindFirstChild(\"Head\")\n\t\t\tlocal humanoidRootPart = character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\t\t\tlocal guiParent = humanoidRootPart or character\n\n\t\t\t-- removing hair etc shit for bald player\n\t\t\tfor _, child in character:GetChildren() do\n\t\t\t\tif child:IsA(\"Accessory\") and child.AccessoryType == Enum.AccessoryType.Hair then\n\t\t\t\t\tchild:Destroy()\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\tif head then\n\t\t\t\t-- creating bbg\n\t\t\t\tlocal gui1 = Instance.new(\"BillboardGui\")\n\t\t\t\tgui1.Adornee = head\n\t\t\t\tgui1.Size = UDim2.new(2.5, 0, 2.5, 0)\n\t\t\t\tgui1.StudsOffset = Vector3.new(0, 0.2, 0)\n\t\t\t\tgui1.AlwaysOnTop = true\n\t\t\t\tgui1.Parent = guiParent\n\n\t\t\t\t-- Create ImageLabel\n\t\t\t\tlocal text1 = Instance.new(\"ImageLabel\")\n\t\t\t\ttext1.Image = \"rbxassetid://ChangeMe\" -- face`s id\n\t\t\t\ttext1.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 1, 0)\n\t\t\t\ttext1.Position = UDim2.new(0, 0, 0, 0)\n\t\t\t\ttext1.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n\t\t\t\ttext1.Parent = gui1\n\n\t\t\t\t-- ending\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nscript.Parent.MouseButton1Click:Connect(click)","owner":{"_id":"67e4fcf68190707878029ac0","username":"markelevskiy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz